# Kart Site Conversion Rules

## Stack (Locked)
- Next.js 15 + `output: 'export'` (static only)
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui
- NO auth, NO database, NO API routes

## Anti-Slop (Mandatory)
Before writing ANY copy, check:
- ❌ Generic → ✅ Specific numbers
- ❌ "Fast" → ✅ "30 seconds"
- ❌ "Affordable" → ✅ "€4.99/month"
- ❌ Stock images → ✅ Card renders
- ❌ Emoji overload

## Conversion Checklist (Every Page)
- [ ] Single, clear CTA per section
- [ ] Trust signals visible without scroll
- [ ] Mobile-first layout
- [ ] < 100KB JS bundle
- [ ] LCP < 2.5s

## Competitor Reference
pryvero.cards — Match quality, beat conversion

## Skills to Use
- `cro` for page optimization
- `copywriting` for all text
- `pricing` for tier structure
- `hallmark` for design review

## Build Order (Do Not Change)
1. Hero (instant gratification messaging)
2. Trust (Visa/MC, security badges)
3. Pricing (3 tiers, transparent)
4. FAQ (objection handling)
5. Polish (performance, mobile)
